# scenario 02.6: Each mistake in the tests is reported
# One case per code. Each error line names the code and the scenario id,
# in the path or in the detail:
# - 05.1 is automated and has no test file: missing-test
# - 05.9 is not in the note: unknown-id
# - the title of 05.2 differs in case: title-mismatch
# - 05.3 uses skip, 05.4 uses stop, 05.5 uses a condition: forbidden-command
cd repo
exec git init -q -b main
exitcode 1 factory check-tests
stdout '^check-tests: error .*(05\.1.*: missing-test|: missing-test .*05\.1)'
stdout '^check-tests: error .*(05\.9.*: unknown-id|: unknown-id .*05\.9)'
stdout '^check-tests: error .*(05\.2.*: title-mismatch|: title-mismatch .*05\.2)'
stdout '^check-tests: error .*(05\.3.*: forbidden-command|: forbidden-command .*05\.3)'
stdout '^check-tests: error .*(05\.4.*: forbidden-command|: forbidden-command .*05\.4)'
stdout '^check-tests: error .*(05\.5.*: forbidden-command|: forbidden-command .*05\.5)'
stdout '^check-tests: \d+ errors$'

-- repo/docs/increments/05-sample/design.md --
# Increment 05: sample

## Goal

- The sample tool works.

## Out of scope

- Everything else.

## Existing tools

- None found; searched for sample tools.

## Interface

- `sample run`

## Scenarios

- **scenario 05.1** (automated) **A thing works.** Given a thing, the tool accepts it.
- **scenario 05.2** (automated) **A second thing works.** Given a second thing, the tool accepts it.
- **scenario 05.3** (automated) **A third thing works.** Given a third thing, the tool accepts it.
- **scenario 05.4** (automated) **A fourth thing works.** Given a fourth thing, the tool accepts it.
- **scenario 05.5** (automated) **A fifth thing works.** Given a fifth thing, the tool accepts it.

## Evidence

- Approved scenarios: 05.1 to 05.5.
-- repo/test/acceptance/05-sample/scenario-05.9.txtar --
# scenario 05.9: A thing that is not in the note works
exec sample run other
-- repo/test/acceptance/05-sample/scenario-05.2.txtar --
# scenario 05.2: a second thing works
exec sample run second
-- repo/test/acceptance/05-sample/scenario-05.3.txtar --
# scenario 05.3: A third thing works
skip 'not ready'
exec sample run third
-- repo/test/acceptance/05-sample/scenario-05.4.txtar --
# scenario 05.4: A fourth thing works
exec sample run fourth
stop
-- repo/test/acceptance/05-sample/scenario-05.5.txtar --
# scenario 05.5: A fifth thing works
[net] exec sample run fifth
